    </section>

    <SectionDivider />

    <!-- Use Cases Section -->
    <section class="relative z-10 px-6 py-20 bg-background-subtle/50">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <H2 class="mb-12 text-center">Perfect for video compression tasks</H2>

        <div class="grid gap-6">
          <div class="bg-background rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <H3 class="mb-2">Social Media & YouTube</H3>
            <Paragraph>
              Compress videos for faster uploads to Instagram, TikTok, YouTube,
              and Twitter. Meet platform file size limits without sacrificing
              quality.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-background rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <H3 class="mb-2">Email & Cloud Storage</H3>
            <Paragraph>
              Reduce video file sizes by 75-90% to stay within email attachment
              limits and save cloud storage space. Perfect for sharing via
              iCloud, Dropbox, or Google Drive.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-background rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <H3 class="mb-2">iPhone Video Management</H3>
            <Paragraph>
              Compress large iPhone MOV videos to free up storage space while
              preserving memories. Convert to efficient formats like H.265 or
              WebM.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-background rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <H3 class="mb-2">Website Optimization</H3>
            <Paragraph>
              Compress video backgrounds, product demos, and promotional content
